<title>NETHERLANDS: VNU details 1996 operating profits.</title>
<headline>VNU details 1996 operating profits.</headline>
<dateline>HAARLEM, Netherlands 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Publisher VNU gave the following breakdown of its 1996 results:</p>
<p>				  Yr 1996		     Yr 1995</p>
<p>			    Sales  Op profit	 Sales  Op profit</p>
<p> Consumer magazines    1,273    192	    1,213     164</p>
<p> Newspapers		  715     89		644	88</p>
<p> Commercial TV	     261	1 loss	 323	36</p>
<p> Business Info Europe    482     53		395	37</p>
<p> Business Info USA	 808    143		711	98</p>
<p> Education		    91     15		 89	13</p>
<p> Miscellaneous charges    --     31		 --	30</p>
<p>NOTES - Sales and operating profit are in millions of guilders.</p>
<p>Commercial TV figures show VNU's pro rata share of sales and operating result of Dutch group HMG (grouping RTL4, RTL5 and Veronica channels) and in Belgium's VTM.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
